        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-21T07:49:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Very fun and interesting episode. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> I would enjoy hearing more of this kind of episode, and a Gen Con live ep would be a blast!</p>\n<p>I have to add: I understand their point about a teleporter in SotM, but I still disagree. (And as a lover of teleporters, I created a home-brew hero to prove it to myself – as one does. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:50:09.228Z",
