        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"saykhia\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/saykhia/48/2132_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> saykhia:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>X-metal wrote:</b><br><blockquote>&nbsp;saykhia wrote:<br><blockquote>&nbsp;X-metal wrote:<br><blockquote>&nbsp;saykhia wrote:<br><blockquote>Later he finds out the fire was started by you-guessed-who, starting his road to redemption.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nvoldemort?\n</blockquote>\n&nbsp;The Mummy.\n</blockquote>\nwho the heck is the mummy?\n</blockquote></div>\nIn the late 90s there was a mummy referred to as he-who-shall-not-be-named.Of course I wasn't actually referring to the mummy.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>this joke took a wildly different direction than I thoight it would.</p>",
